## Key import paths (`@cloudinary/url-gen` — use exactly, do not guess subpaths)

| Purpose | Import |
|---------|--------|
| Resize fill | `import { fill } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/actions/resize'` |
| Resize scale | `import { scale } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/actions/resize'` |
| Delivery format / quality | `import { format, quality } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/actions/delivery'` |
| Format auto | `import { auto } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/qualifiers/format'` |
| Quality auto | `import { auto as autoQuality } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/qualifiers/quality'` |
| Overlay source | `import { source } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/actions/overlay'` |
| Overlay text / image | `import { text, image } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/qualifiers/source'` |
| Position | `import { Position } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/qualifiers/position'` |
| Gravity compass | `import { compass } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/qualifiers/gravity'` |
| TextStyle | `import { TextStyle } from '@cloudinary/url-gen/qualifiers/textStyle'` |

Components (`AdvancedImage`, `AdvancedVideo`, plugins) come from `@cloudinary/react`, not `@cloudinary/url-gen`.

